'''Ultimate Way Big''' is the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]]'s artificially [[Ultimate Forms|evolved]] DNA sample of a [[To'kustar (Classic)|To'kustar]].

==Appearance==
Ultimate Way Big is almost identical to [[Way Big (Classic)|Way Big]] in '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' and '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]'''. The white parts of his body except for his chest, hands, and face are changed to blue, and he has two curved horns on the left and right sides of his head. The red parts of his body except for his shoulders and cheeks are now white, and the black parts of his body are now red. He is also bigger in size than Way Big.

Ultimate Way Big wears the evolved [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his chest.

