Ultimate Way Big can shoot a powerful cosmic ray as either projectiles or beams from the outer edge of his right hand by crossing his arms together.{{Refn|While [[Way Big (Classic)|Way Big]] shoots cosmic rays by putting his right hand vertical and left hand horizontal in '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', Ultimate Way Big does this by instead putting his left hand vertical and his right hand horizontal.|group = note}} Ultimate Way Big is also able to create cosmic energy saws that were able to cut off one of [[Dagon|Dagon's]] tentacles.

Ultimate Way Big can spin around fast enough to repel Dagon's laser beams. He can also jump extremely high and fly.

Ultimate Way Big is stronger than [[Way Big (Classic)|Way Big]], as he was able to pull Dagon to the ground, who was gargantuan when compared to Ultimate Way Big's size at the time.

Ultimate Way Big has immense durability, being able to withstand Dagon's energy beams.

==Weaknesses==
[[File:TUE2 (100).png|thumb|Acid Vulnerability]]
Ultimate Way Big was shown to be vulnerable to Dagon's acid rain.

==History==
===Ultimate Alien===
*Ultimate Way Big first appeared in ''[[The Ultimate Enemy: Part 2]]'', where he battled [[Dagon]], but was eventually defeated by the acid rain brought down on him.

